SportsBallVideo is split-licensed. There is no single license for the whole
repository.

  processing/  and  ml/      GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only
                             (see processing/LICENSE, ml/LICENSE)

  everything else            Apache License, Version 2.0
                             (see app/LICENSE, web/LICENSE, api/LICENSE,
                              infra/LICENSE, shared/LICENSE, and
                              LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt for root files)

Each source file declares its license with an SPDX-License-Identifier
header, and REUSE.toml covers files that cannot carry a header. Where a
file's header and this summary disagree, the header governs.

Full license texts are in the LICENSES/ directory.

See docs/LICENSING.md for the rules that keep the two halves separate.
